      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "모냥은 디안시나이트에\n관심을 보이고 있다.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BAA8B0E5C7400020B514C548C2DCB098C774D2B8C5D0000AAD00C2ECC7440020BCF4C774ACE00020C788B2E4002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "냐아앙?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 792,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B0D0C544C559003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "냐앙!!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B0D0C559002100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "모냥이 누군가의 텔레파시를\n감지한 모양인데?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 816,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BAA8B0E5C7740020B204AD70AC00C7580020D154B808D30CC2DCB97C000AAC10C9C0D55C0020BAA8C591C778B370003F00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "모냥은 남의 생각을\n다른 누군가에게 전달할 수 있거든.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BAA8B0E5C7400020B0A8C7580020C0DDAC01C744000AB2E4B9780020B204AD70AC00C5D0AC8C0020C804B2ECD5600020C2180020C788AC70B4E0002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "체력을 크게 소비하는 일이라\n쓰지 말라 하고 있는데도<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n가끔 이렇게 감지할 때가 있어.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 948,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CCB4B825C7440020D06CAC8C0020C18CBE44D558B2940020C77CC774B77C000AC4F0C9C00020B9D0B77C0020D558ACE00020C788B294B370B3C400100001BE00000AAC00B0540020C774B807AC8C0020AC10C9C0D5600020B54CAC000020C788C5B4002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그건 그렇고 신경 쓰이지 않아?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n모냥이 디안시나이트에서\n감지해 낸 것 말이야.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8AC740020ADF8B807ACE00020C2E0ACBD0020C4F0C774C9C00020C54AC544003F00100001BE01000ABAA8B0E5C7740020B514C548C2DCB098C774D2B8C5D0C11C000AAC10C9C0D5740020B0B80020AC830020B9D0C774C57C002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>,\n모냥의 뒤를 쫓아가 보자.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1164,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000002C000ABAA8B0E5C7580020B4A4B97C0020CAD3C544AC000020BCF4C790002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1216,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "뭔가가 느껴지는 모양이야.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BB54AC00AC000020B290AEF4C9C0B2940020BAA8C591C774C57C002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "잠깐 기다려.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C7A0AE500020AE30B2E4B824002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "여보세요, 젬마?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5ECBCF4C138C694002C0020C82CB9C8003F00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "지금 모냥과 조사 중인데\n너희 도움이 필요할 것 같아서 말이야.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C9C0AE080020BAA8B0E5ACFC0020C870C0AC0020C911C778B370000AB108D76C0020B3C4C6C0C7740020D544C694D5600020AC830020AC19C544C11C0020B9D0C774C57C002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "응, 에블레랑 마몰에게도 전해 줘.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C751002C0020C5D0BE14B808B7910020B9C8BAB0C5D0AC8CB3C40020C804D5740020C918002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "미안 미안, 오랜 동료에게\n연락 좀 하느라.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BBF8C5480020BBF8C548002C0020C624B79C0020B3D9B8CCC5D0AC8C000AC5F0B77D0020C8800020D558B290B77C002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "오랜 사이예요?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C624B79C0020C0ACC774C608C694003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "동료요?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B3D9B8CCC694003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "응, 나는 2대 소장이잖아.\n초대는 핸섬이라는 사람이었어.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C751002C0020B098B29400200032B3000020C18CC7A5C774C796C544002E000ACD08B300B2940020D578C12CC774B77CB2940020C0ACB78CC774C5C8C5B4002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그래서 핸섬 하우스인 거예요?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B798C11C0020D578C12C0020D558C6B0C2A4C7780020AC70C608C694003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "사무소 이름의 그...?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0ACBB34C18C0020C774B984C7580020ADF8002E002E002E003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "맞아! 아저씨는 엄청 상냥한 데다\n공부도 가르쳐 주셨어...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B9DEC54400210020C544C800C528B2940020C5C4CCAD0020C0C1B0E5D55C0020B370B2E4000AACF5BD80B3C40020AC00B974CCD00020C8FCC168C5B4002E002E002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "국제경찰이라 지금은\n사건을 해결하러 멀리 떠나 버렸고.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AD6DC81CACBDCC30C774B77C0020C9C0AE08C740000AC0ACAC74C7440020D574ACB0D558B7EC0020BA40B9AC0020B5A0B0980020BC84B838ACE0002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그래서 조금 전에 통화한 동료나\n모냥의 도움을 받으면서<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n어떻게든 2대 소장을 해내고 있는 거야.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1828,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B798C11C0020C870AE080020C804C5D00020D1B5D654D55C0020B3D9B8CCB098000ABAA8B0E5C7580020B3C4C6C0C7440020BC1BC73CBA74C11C00100001BE00000AC5B4B5BBAC8CB4E000200032B3000020C18CC7A5C7440020D574B0B4ACE00020C788B2940020AC70C57C002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "특히 모냥의 텔레파시는 너무나도 굉장해서\n덕분에 해결한 어려운 사건도<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n잔뜩 있을 정도야!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1952,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D2B9D7880020BAA8B0E5C7580020D154B808D30CC2DCB2940020B108BB34B098B3C40020AD49C7A5D574C11C000AB355BD84C5D00020D574ACB0D55C0020C5B4B824C6B40020C0ACAC74B3C400100001BE00000AC794B7290020C788C7440020C815B3C4C57C002100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "조금 전에도 말했다시피\n많이 사용하면 지쳐 버리지만 말이야.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 2068,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C870AE080020C804C5D0B3C40020B9D0D588B2E4C2DCD53C000AB9CEC7740020C0ACC6A9D558BA740020C9C0CCD00020BC84B9ACC9C0B9CC0020B9D0C774C57C002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "냐아앙?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 2144,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B0D0C544C559003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "냐앙!!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 2156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B0D0C559002100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>,\n우리도 따라가 보자!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 2168,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000002C000AC6B0B9ACB3C40020B530B77CAC000020BCF4C790002100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 2212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "모냥, 설마 내 마음을 감지한 거야?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 2224,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BAA8B0E5002C0020C124B9C80020B0B40020B9C8C74CC7440020AC10C9C0D55C0020AC70C57C003F00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "모냥의 파워 덕분일까...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 2276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BAA8B0E5C7580020D30CC6CC0020B355BD84C77CAE4C002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "마티에르의 생각이\n머릿속에 떠오른다...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n... ... ...\n... ... ...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n“모냥이 대체 왜 저러지?\n그건 그렇고 배가 고프네...”<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n... ... ...\n... ... ...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 2308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 113
    },
    {
      "displayText": "마티에르 씨?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 2536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B9C8D2F0C5D0B9740020C528003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "혹시 배고프세요?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 2552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D639C2DC0020BC30ACE0D504C138C694003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "헤헤...\n조금 배가 고프긴 했어.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 2572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D5E4D5E4002E002E002E000AC870AE080020BC30AC000020ACE0D504AE340020D588C5B4002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "냐아앙!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B0D0C544C55900210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "고마워, 모냥.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 2632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ACE0B9C8C6CC002C0020BAA8B0E5002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그럼 여기서 잠깐\n연료를 보급하고 갈까!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7FC0020C5ECAE30C11C0020C7A0AE50000AC5F0B8CCB97C0020BCF4AE09D558ACE00020AC08AE4C002100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "정말 맛있었어!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 2716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C815B9D00020B9DBC788C5C8C5B4002100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그럼 모냥,\n가고 싶은 곳을 알려 줘.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 2744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7FC0020BAA8B0E5002C000AAC00ACE00020C2F6C7400020ACF3C7440020C54CB8240020C918002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "냐아앙?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
