      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 3088,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "모냥이 감지해 낸 게\n여기 있다는 거지?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 3100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BAA8B0E5C7740020AC10C9C0D5740020B0B80020AC8C000AC5ECAE300020C788B2E4B2940020AC70C9C0003F00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "냐앙!!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 3156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B0D0C559002100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "메가결정이 잔뜩 있어.\n확실히 부자연스러운 일이네.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 3168,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BA54AC00ACB0C815C7740020C794B7290020C788C5B4002E000AD655C2E4D7880020BD80C790C5F0C2A4B7ECC6B40020C77CC774B124002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "냐아아~앙!!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 3236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B0D0C544C544007EC559002100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "멜리시...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 3252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BA5CB9ACC2DC002E002E002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "다른 한 마리는 뭐지?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 3276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2E4B9780020D55C0020B9C8B9ACB2940020BB50C9C0003F00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "너의 메가스톤과\n어떤 관계가 있는 것 아닐까?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 59,
      "offsetInSection": 3312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B108C7580020BA54AC00C2A4D1A4ACFC000AC5B4B5A40020AD00ACC4AC000020C788B2940020AC830020C544B2D0AE4C003F00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "냐앙!!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 60,
      "offsetInSection": 3372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B0D0C559002100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "메가스톤과 무슨 관계가 있는지\n잡아서 확인해 보자!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 61,
      "offsetInSection": 3384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BA54AC00C2A4D1A4ACFC0020BB34C2A80020AD00ACC4AC000020C788B294C9C0000AC7A1C544C11C0020D655C778D5740020BCF4C790002100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "냐아아~앙!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 62,
      "offsetInSection": 3452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B0D0C544C544007EC55900210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 63,
      "offsetInSection": 3468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "디안~!!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 64,
      "offsetInSection": 3480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B514C548007E002100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
