    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿A",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 65,
      "offsetInSection": 3492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00410000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "잡아야 해!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 66,
      "offsetInSection": 3504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C7A1C544C57C0020D574002100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "쓰러뜨리지 말고 잡아야 해!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 67,
      "offsetInSection": 3528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C4F0B7ECB728B9ACC9C00020B9D0ACE00020C7A1C544C57C0020D574002100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "축하해!\n역시 <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0002>ᤀ<U+0006>야.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 68,
      "offsetInSection": 3568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CD95D558D5740021000AC5EDC2DC002000100002010000000010000219000006C57C002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "있잖아, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>.\n방금 잡은 포켓몬을 보여 주지 않을래?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 69,
      "offsetInSection": 3616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C788C796C544002C00200010000201000000002E000ABC29AE080020C7A1C7400020D3ECCF13BAACC7440020BCF4C5EC0020C8FCC9C00020C54AC744B798003F00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "예쁘다...!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 70,
      "offsetInSection": 3692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C608C058B2E4002E002E002E002100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "향전 해시계가 떠오를 정도로\n반짝반짝한 포켓몬이네!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 71,
      "offsetInSection": 3716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D5A5C8040020D574C2DCACC4AC000020B5A0C624B97C0020C815B3C4B85C000ABC18C9DDBC18C9DDD55C0020D3ECCF13BAACC774B124002100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "향전이요?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 72,
      "offsetInSection": 3784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D5A5C804C774C694003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "해시계요?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 73,
      "offsetInSection": 3796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D574C2DCACC4C694003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "응, 향전시티라는 도시에\n정체불명의 해시계가 있거든.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n메가스톤과 어떤 관계가 있다나 봐.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 74,
      "offsetInSection": 3808,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C751002C0020D5A5C804C2DCD2F0B77CB2940020B3C4C2DCC5D0000AC815CCB4BD88BA85C7580020D574C2DCACC4AC000020C788AC70B4E0002E00100001BE00000ABA54AC00C2A4D1A4ACFC0020C5B4B5A40020AD00ACC4AC000020C788B2E4B0980020BD10002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "많은 일들이 떠오르네.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 75,
      "offsetInSection": 3924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B9CEC7400020C77CB4E4C7740020B5A0C624B974B124002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "핸섬 아저씨가 떠난 뒤로\n알게 된 사람들이 있어.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 76,
      "offsetInSection": 3960,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D578C12C0020C544C800C528AC000020B5A0B09C0020B4A4B85C000AC54CAC8C0020B41C0020C0ACB78CB4E4C7740020C788C5B4002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "한 명은 AZ 씨고\n다른 한 명은 플라타느박사님이야.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 77,
      "offsetInSection": 4024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D55C0020BA85C74000200041005A0020C528ACE0000AB2E4B9780020D55C0020BA85C7400020D50CB77CD0C0B290BC15C0ACB2D8C774C57C002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "박사님은 메가진화를 연구하는 분이신데\nAZ 씨와 이런 이야기를 한 적이 있어.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 78,
      "offsetInSection": 4092,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BC15C0ACB2D8C7400020BA54AC00C9C4D654B97C0020C5F0AD6CD558B2940020BD84C774C2E0B370000A0041005A0020C528C6400020C774B7F00020C774C57CAE30B97C0020D55C0020C801C7740020C788C5B4002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "3000년 전에 발사된 최종병기의 빛...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n전설의 포켓몬의 파워를 받은 돌이\n메가스톤이 된 것이 아니냐고 말이야.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 79,
      "offsetInSection": 4188,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0033003000300030B1440020C804C5D00020BC1CC0ACB41C0020CD5CC885BCD1AE30C7580020BE5B002E002E002E00100001BE01000AC804C124C7580020D3ECCF13BAACC7580020D30CC6CCB97C0020BC1BC7400020B3CCC774000ABA54AC00C2A4D1A4C7740020B41C0020AC83C7740020C544B2C8B0D0ACE00020B9D0C774C57C002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "AZ 씨는 고개를 끄덕이면서<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n그래서 요즘 새로운 종류의\n메가스톤이 발견되는 거라고 했어.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 80,
      "offsetInSection": 4332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041005A0020C528B2940020ACE0AC1CB97C0020B044B355C774BA74C11C00100001BE01000AADF8B798C11C0020C694C9980020C0C8B85CC6B40020C885B958C758000ABA54AC00C2A4D1A4C7740020BC1CACACB418B2940020AC70B77CACE00020D588C5B4002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "...5년 전에도\n최종병기가 사용됐었거든.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 81,
      "offsetInSection": 4448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "002E002E002E0035B1440020C804C5D0B3C4000ACD5CC885BCD1AE30AC000020C0ACC6A9B410C5C8AC70B4E0002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "냐아...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 82,
      "offsetInSection": 4504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B0D0C544002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "걱정하지 않아도 돼, 모냥.\n미르에는 <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0002>ᤀ<U+0006>랑 내가 있잖아!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 83,
      "offsetInSection": 4516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC71C815D558C9C00020C54AC544B3C40020B3FC002C0020BAA8B0E5002E000ABBF8B974C5D0B294002000100002010000000010000219000006B7910020B0B4AC000020C788C796C544002100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>,\n이 포켓몬도 소중히 대해 줘.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 84,
      "offsetInSection": 4604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000002C000AC7740020D3ECCF13BAACB3C40020C18CC911D7880020B300D5740020C918002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "우리 미르에는 너처럼 다양한 포켓몬과\n유대를 다질 수 있는 사람이 필요하니까.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 85,
      "offsetInSection": 4660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C6B0B9AC0020BBF8B974C5D0B2940020B108CC98B7FC0020B2E4C591D55C0020D3ECCF13BAACACFC000AC720B300B97C0020B2E4C9C80020C2180020C788B2940020C0ACB78CC7740020D544C694D558B2C8AE4C002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그럼, 우리는 핸섬 하우스로 돌아가 볼게.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 86,
      "offsetInSection": 4756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7FC002C0020C6B0B9ACB2940020D578C12C0020D558C6B0C2A4B85C0020B3CCC544AC000020BCFCAC8C002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그렇지! AZ 씨가\n이런 이야기도 했었어.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 87,
      "offsetInSection": 4812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B807C9C0002100200041005A0020C528AC00000AC774B7F00020C774C57CAE30B3C40020D588C5C8C5B4002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "플라엣테를 찾기 위한 기나긴 여정 중<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n여기서 멀리 떨어진 호연지방에서\n메가진화의 시작이라 할 수 있는 현상도<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n목격했었다고 말이야!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 88,
      "offsetInSection": 4868,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그래서 AZ 씨는\n포켓몬과 인간의 유대에 대해<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n줄곧 생각해 온 모양이야.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
